<h1>About WhichPadel</h1>
<p>WhichPadel is an independent padel racket comparison site. We compile racket specifications from brand and retailer sources, calculate ratings from those published specs with a consistent formula, and record shop prices with a check date.</p>
<h2>Our data</h2>
<p>Ratings are calculated from published specifications (shape, weight, balance, core and face). They are not lab or on-court tests. Prices are recorded snapshots, not live quotes. Some links are affiliate links; see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
<p class="muted small">Some specification data adapted from PadelTrue, licensed CC BY 4.0.</p>
